# ============================================================================
# CHERRYGROVE CITY, expanded  (28x20 blocks, buffer 884/1300; vanilla 20x11)
# ============================================================================
# KEPT: the vanilla west shoreline is pasted verbatim into the NW corner
#   (rocks, sand bars, islets: rows 2-8, cols 0-8) so the town reads as
#   Cherrygrove; Route 30 leaves north, Route 29 east on a two-wide road;
#   Center + Cafe on the north side; Guide Gent's house; cherry trees (ac);
#   the Mystic Water fisher by the water; the rival meets you at the east
#   entrance; fruit trees.
# ADDED (cf. pokefollow Viridian 20x18 -> 23x20: denser, a second street):
#   North avenue (Route 30) through the centre, crossing the main street.
#   A Mart (18 19/16 17) and a second street of houses (Guide Gent moves to
#     its west end, by the water).
#   Fishing pier (89) off the house lane: Mystic Water fisher at its tip.
#   The Cherry Grove itself (south half): a blossom wood with a winding
#     path to a flower clearing, fruit trees inside, picnic NPCs.
#   Sea runs the full west side: Surf south to new water (future link to a
#     coastal route / Route 27's south shore).
# CONNECTIONS: N cols 13-14 (steps 26-29) -> Route 30 (offset changes);
#   E rows 4-5 (steps 8-11) -> Route 29 W row 6: align with offset.
# TODO: Pokemon Center art stays until the no-Center plan decides (swap to
#   an inn); cherry trees stay pink in winter (open question).
# ============================================================================
ref CherrygroveCity
key a=18 b=19 g=1a h=1b m=16 n=17 c=2c d=2d e=2e f=2f 1=14 2=15 k=ac B=89
key r=31 R=32 o=0a X=36 Y=3a [=58 M=71 {=79 Z=30 W=39 V=34
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTTT..TTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTTTTTT,*,,..,,,,cd,ab,kTT
^o^^oo..,12,,..,,,,ef,gh,*TT
rrR~~.....,,,..,,,,.,,.,,,,T
o~Y~~.......................
~Xo[~~~.....................
~XoM[~~~o*k*,..,*k*,,,ab,,,T
~X^^{~Zo]*,*,..,*,*,,,mn,,,T
~orRWWV~],,,,..,,,,,,,.,,,,T
~~~~~~~~],,,,..,,,,,,,,,,,,T
~~~~~~~~]12,,..,,12,,,12,,,T
~~~~BBBBB..................T
~~R~~~~~],,k,..,kk,,kk,,k,,T
~~~~~~~~],kk,..kkk,*kkk,,kkT
~~~~~~~~]*,,k......,kkk,,,kT
~~~r~~~~]k,,,k,kk..,kk,*,,kT
~~~~~~~~],*,kkkkk........,kT
~~~~~~~~]kk,,k,kk,,kk,**,,kT
~~~~~~~~]kkk,kkkkkkkkk,,kkkT
~~~~~~~~]TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
end
exit N 27 0
exit E 55 9
exit PIER 8 23
obj warp 19 5 EvolutionHouse
obj warp 39 5 Cafe
obj warp 45 5 PokeCenter
obj warp 45 15 Mart
obj warp 19 21 GuideGentsHouse
obj warp 35 21 GymSpeechHouse
obj warp 43 21 House
obj npc 52 9 GuideGent down
obj npc 8 22 MysticWaterFisher left
obj npc 30 12 Teacher
obj npc 22 17 Youngster
